ginally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1504330-truth-or-dare#post1504330\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What kinds of questions/dares would happen at a Gangrel gather if they decided to play it?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it would be simpler things like:<br /> <br /> The weirdest place you've ever slept, which can be pretty interesting if you consider the &quot;Earth Meld&quot; skill;<br /> <br /> If there was an animal that he was already curious about feeding, if you think that in zoos the options can be very strange or exotic;<br /> <br /> If you've ever lost prey to another Kindred, I can think of it happening in the case of any Ventrue, Brujah or even Malkavian, it could start a very good story indeed;<br /> <br /> What's the worst trouble you've gotten into for a job/favor? This one is cool because there are a lot of strange and even comical things you can do with it, here are some examples:<br /> <br /> &quot;A few years ago I formed a cortorie with a toreador bitch and two of those sewer rats, we got together because of a strange group that was invading our territory, it didn't seem like a difficult thing, until the bitch tried to betray us because of the her blue blood boyfriend, one of the sewer rats was destroyed and i had to spend a week living in the sewers and i still lost my hunting territory, at least that bitch was left out to dry in the sun by her boyfriend.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I broke into the home of the Ventrue once, I heard he had stolen a treasure from one of the elders, I thought if I could get my hands on it I might have an elder owing me a favor, but I was caught off guard by a hound. on guard, a gargoyle, we fought and he put a stake through my chest. I woke up the next night inside a container, who took me out was a girl, Malkavian I think, she had a strange way. I learned later that the reason was because she had stolen the treasure herself and had only released me to serve as decoy for a night or two, I never saw her again after that night, but if I see.&quot;\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-04T13:51:49-08:00","id":1504382,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1504330-truth-or-dare#post1504330\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> What kinds of queWhat kinds of questions/dares would happen at a Sabbat gathering if they decided to play it?</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know if I'm being prejudiced, but I can only think of some very absurd cases:<br /> <br /> Brujah daring each other to receive an electric shock to their own tongues; Challenges between Brujah, Gangrel, Nosferatu and maybe a Ventrue or two, daring each other to take punches from one another, use of disciplines allowed; A Nosferatu male daring a girl from the other clans to kiss his festering face, which couldn't be missed, and the others betting which one of them will kill him; A Gangrel 